 "notes": "Deep Stacks pack atlas (C2-sprites-boss), merged into bosses_battle by the loader. The Binder (B100) on the Archivore's kit: binder (The Spine: cold vellum wings, an ink cover, a crimson thread stitched down the spine with gold knots, a wax-seal amber eye), binder_loose (Loose Leaves: the knots torn out one in two, wings spread wide and high, seven loose leaves circling), binder_binding (The Last Binding: the outer pages burnt to ember fronts, a dark cover with the thread burning across it, the eye swollen). Each with _idle_1 (breathe), _attack (lunge, slit eye), _hurt (recoil, eye shut), _cast (the inhale: wings fold, eye burns, ink and vellum motes), _devour (the eye swells, the tendrils reach), _die_0..2 (burns from the top: ember front, vellum ash); anims <id>_idle and <id>_die. Facing RIGHT, 1x, untinted, origin = bottom-centre (the default, exact for every frame; the table agrees). BINDER.sprite.frame = binder; phases 2 and 3 carry sprite: binder_loose / binder_binding so the scene swaps the frame set on the phase banner (the King's unmask path)."
